            "review_title": "Review at Tonda Pizza Vietnam - Vincom Mega Mall Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Kinda\n1 contribution\n0\nThe WORST PIZZA\nSep 2019 • Friends\nWent there with a group of 4 for lunch. \nThe pizza was the worst. It was tiny ! It was burnt and had a funny taste. Nooooo good! Our friends had pasta. It was mushy and tasteless. \nTheir photos must be photoshopped. \nFind another place !\nWritten October 4, 2019\nTonda P\nDear Kindacong,\n\nThank you for your time and your review. We are sorry to hear about your disappointment. We always try our best to make our customers satisfied.\n\nOur Italian chef will take in your opinion and overview the problem in a serious manner so that we can improve our foods to fit your taste next time.\n\nOnce again, we apologize and we will be glad to have you back at our restaurant for giving us a second chance to compensate for you. For details, kindly help to contact our hotline: +84 898 14 0898.\n\nBest regards,\n\nTonda Pizza HCMC\nRead more\nWritten October 12, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
